OL,3,GNEWSAReward offered over murder in flat
OL,4,Aused as brothel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #20,000 reward is being offered by
OL,7,FCrimestoppers in connection with the
OL,8,Fmurder of a man who was found dead in a
OL,9,FBirmingham flat in 2022.
OL,11,FJinming Zhang had been stabbed multiple
OL,12,Ftimes before he was found in the
OL,13,Fproperty, which police said was being
OL,14,Fused as a brothel, in Moseley Street in
OL,15,FDigbeth.
OL,17,FWest Midlands Police previously
OL,18,Freleased CCTV of a suspect, while a DNA
OL,19,Fsample from the suspected killer found
OL,20,Fat the scene did not produce a match on
OL,21,Fthe national database.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
