OL,4,Aused as brothel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case was featured in the BBC series
OL,7,Fof Forensics: The Real CSI last year,
OL,8,Fwhich revealed police believed the
OL,9,Fmurder suspect may have sustained a
OL,10,Fhand injury in the frenzied attack.
